# Scratch renders, live server logs and the large binaries inside the runtime
# store are reproducible: `npx tsx scripts/foundry/run.ts benchmark` rebuilds the
# renders, and the store's own addVersion copies the model again. The records
# (project.json, versions/*/record.json) ARE committed so the version history,
# validation and render list stay auditable.
_smoke/
*.log
*.pid
store/**/model.glb
store/**/renders/
